  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women Deliver Conference - Advocacy for Grassroots (Women&apos;s Rights and anti-rollback efforts) SRHR - 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This will convene over 6000 people in person in Kigali, Rwanda 16-20 July, as well as over 200,000 online. The conference aims to catalyse collective action for gender equality; hold leaders accountable to commitments; empower the feminist movement and to centre grassroots organisations and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
